OL,4,BDefender Heaven open to leaving Man Utd
OL,5,GManchester United defender Ayden       
OL,6,GHeaven is open to a loan move in       
OL,7,GJanuary amid concerns over his game    
OL,8,Gtime as his side battles in the        
OL,9,GPremier League relegation zone.        
OL,11,FThe 20-year-old centre-back is         
OL,12,Fconcerned about what United's current  
OL,13,Fsituation means for his development,   
OL,14,Fafter new manager Mauricio Pochettino  
OL,15,Fleft him as an unused substitute in    
OL,16,FSunday's 4-0 defeat at Liverpool.      
